# Kimss Python SDK — AI assistants

Follow [AI_INTEGRATION.md](AI_INTEGRATION.md).

1. Never use `KimssClient` for chat/completions/messages.
2. Keep the developer's native `openai` or `anthropic` SDK.
3. OpenAI → `base_url=https://api.kimss.ai/v1`. Anthropic → `base_url=https://api.kimss.ai`.
4. Always inject `X-Kimss-Agent-Id` (and `X-Kimss-Agent-Name`).
5. Hermis: forward Agent-Id headers.
6. Kill switch: `agent_disabled`. Keys: `kimss_...`.
